{"text": "BACOO COMPANY\n\nMEMORANDUM\n\nMemo 5474\nJanuary 30, 1998\n\u20180: M. A. Sudholt\nFROM: F. R. Perini\n\nSUBJECT: Summary Report and Overview on the New Eclipse\n(Hollow Filter) Analyses\n\nPROJECT: B 622\n\nFINDINGS:\n\nThe majority of analytical data obtained on the 1997 New Eclipse\ncigarettes indicate minimal or no changes from the 1996 vantage\nEclipse construction. Exceptions include a new, hollow filter and\na significantly smaller filter tow fiber denier per filament\n(~ 1/6). Further, the glycerol concentration on the light RL\nsegment is 88.5 % higher than in the Vantage Eclipse cigarettes,\nwhile the menthol is also higher, by 51.6-68.4 %.\n\n(Continued on next page.)\n\nF. R. Perini\n\n7a 22118\nAttachments\nXe: R. F. Bondurant Vv. Norman\n3. 3. Chapman R. B. Patterson\nE. W. Cochran J. R. Reid\nB. 3. Craven S. F. Roof\nW. R. Deaton D. R. Smart\nC. H. Bfird R. M. Stepnowski\nVv. G. Garrard R. D. Stevens\nD. A. Grider R. M. Striegel\nA.M. Thrig R. T. Walker\nT. D. Jessup D. L. Williams\nJ. M. Johnson E. Cc. Wu\nS. T. Jones Library\n\nT, M, Larson\n\n69197596",
